text = "In Memoriam: A Private Investigator Who Never Quite Got It Right

This private investigator passed away, leaving behind a career marked more by persistence than triumph. His methods, often unorthodox, led him down countless false paths, and his conclusions rarely hit the mark. Yet, his drive to uncover the truth never wavered, even when the cases grew colder and the answers seemed forever out of reach. Though he never solved the big case or achieved the recognition he sought, his unwavering dedication to justice was undeniable. In the end, his legacy is not one of success, but of relentless pursuit, never satisfied, always searching, even when the truth remained just beyond his grasp.

Condolences to the family, if applicable."
horizontal_alignment = 1
vertical_alignment = 1
autowrap_mode = 3
